msgstr "Approximately %(distance)s km from Apartment Cvikov."

#: apartmancvikov/views.py:98 apartmancvikov/views.py:108
msgid ""
"Poptávku se nepodařilo odeslat. Zkuste to prosím později nebo nás "
"kontaktujte přímo e-mailem či telefonem."
msgstr ""
"We could not send the enquiry. Please try again later or contact us directly "
"by email or phone."

#: apartmancvikov/views.py:116
msgid "Děkujeme, poptávka byla odeslána. Ozveme se vám co nejdříve."
msgstr ""
"Thank you, your enquiry has been sent. We will get back to you as soon as "
"possible."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Koupaliště Sloup v Čechách"
msgstr "Sloup v Čechách swimming lake"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Přírodní koupaliště v kempu s lanovým centrem a občerstvením."
msgstr ""
"A natural swimming area at a campsite with a high ropes course and "
"refreshments."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Ze Cvikova se sem můžete vydat také autobusem."
msgstr "You can also get there by bus from Cvikov."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Koupaliště Jablonné v Podještědí"
msgstr "Jablonné v Podještědí swimming pool"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid ""
"Koupaliště v kempu s dětským hřištěm, restaurací a nafukovací skluzavkou na "
"vodě."
msgstr ""
"A campsite swimming pool with a children's playground, restaurant and "
"inflatable water slide."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Rekreační areál Kristýna"
msgstr "Kristýna recreation area"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid ""
"Koupání v zatopeném bývalém dole s písčitou pláží, dětským hřištěm, šlapadly "
"a restaurací."
msgstr ""
"Swimming in a flooded former mine with a sandy beach, children's playground, "
"pedal boats and restaurant."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Horské koupaliště Jonsdorf"
msgstr "Jonsdorf mountain swimming pool"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid ""
"Koupaliště s tobogánem, dětským bazénem, vzduchovou trampolínou a "
"občerstvením."
msgstr ""
"A swimming pool with a water slide, children's pool, air trampoline and "
"refreshments."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid ""
"V létě sem podle aktuálního jízdního řádu jezdí horský expres z náměstí ve "
"Cvikově."
msgstr ""
"In summer, subject to the current timetable, the mountain express runs here "
"from the square in Cvikov."

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Koupaliště Dubice"
msgstr "Dubice swimming pool"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid ""
"Koupaliště u České Lípy s tobogány a brouzdalištěm. Na přilehlém rybníce je "
"možné vyzkoušet wakeboarding, paddleboarding i koupání a v okolí je volně "
"přístupné 3D bludiště."
msgstr ""
"A swimming pool near Česká Lípa with water slides and a paddling pool. Try "
"wakeboarding, paddleboarding or swimming on the adjacent lake and visit the "
"freely accessible 3D maze nearby."

#: apartmancvikov/structured_data.py apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Výlety s koupáním z Apartmánu Cvikov"
msgstr "Swimming trips from Apartmán Cvikov"

#: apartmancvikov/structured_data.py apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid ""
"Šest tipů na koupání v okolí Apartmánu Cvikov: Sloup v Čechách, Jablonné v "
"Podještědí, Kristýna, Jonsdorf, Dubice a Česká Kamenice."
msgstr ""
"Six swimming tips near Apartmán Cvikov: Sloup v Čechách, Jablonné v "
"Podještědí, Kristýna, Jonsdorf, Dubice and Česká Kamenice."

#: apartmancvikov/structured_data.py apartmancvikov/templates/vylety.html
#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Výlety s koupáním"
msgstr "Swimming trips"

#: apartmancvikov/structured_data.py
msgid "Koupání v okolí Cvikova"
msgstr "Swimming near Cvikov"

#: apartmancvikov/structured_data.py apartmancvikov/templates/vylety.html
#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Horské koupaliště Jonsdorf s tobogánem"
msgstr "Jonsdorf mountain swimming pool with a water slide"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Koupání v okolí Cvikova | Apartmán Cvikov"
msgstr "Swimming near Cvikov | Apartmán Cvikov"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html apartmancvikov/templates/vylety.html
msgid ""
"Přírodní koupaliště, bazény a jezera pro osvěžení i celodenní rodinný výlet."
msgstr ""
"Natural swimming areas, pools and lakes for a refreshing dip or a full-day "
"family trip."

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid ""
"Pokud vás omrzí bazén na zahradě nebo chcete spojit koupání s výletem, je v "
"okolí několik možností."
msgstr ""
"If you tire of the garden pool or want to combine a swim with a day trip, "
"there are several options nearby."

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Koupání"
msgstr "Swimming"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "K vodě"
msgstr "By the water"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Šest míst pro malé i velké plavce"
msgstr "Six places for swimmers of all ages"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid ""
"Vyberte si přírodní koupaliště, horský bazén nebo jezero s dalšími aktivitami "
"pro děti. Před odjezdem doporučujeme ověřit aktuální otevírací dobu a "
"podmínky koupání na webu provozovatele."
msgstr ""
"Choose a natural swimming area, mountain pool or lake with more activities "
"for children. Before setting off, we recommend checking current opening "
"hours and swimming conditions on the operator's website."

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Doprava:"
msgstr "Transport:"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Další nápady"
msgstr "More ideas"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Vyberte si další rodinný výlet"
msgstr "Choose another family trip"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid ""
"V okolí najdete také skály, hrady, vyhlídky, sklárny a program pro deštivé "
"dny."
msgstr ""
"You will also find rocks, castles, viewpoints, glassworks and rainy-day "
"activities nearby."

#: apartmancvikov/templates/koupani.html
msgid "Všechny výlety"
msgstr "All trips"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/vylety.html
msgid "Šest tipů v okolí"
msgstr "Six nearby tips"

#: apartmancvikov/templates/vylety.html
msgid "Prohlédnout koupání"
msgstr "Explore swimming options"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid "Městské koupaliště Česká Kamenice"
msgstr "Česká Kamenice municipal swimming pool"

#: apartmancvikov/content.py
msgid ""
"Koupaliště s bistrem. Návštěvu lze spojit s výletem k ručnímu přívozu a do "
"parku miniatur Mlýnky Brand, kam se dostanete i s kočárkem, nebo na skalní "
"vyhlídku Ponorka."
msgstr ""
"A swimming pool with a bistro. Combine your visit with a trip to the hand-"
"operated ferry and the Mlýnky Brand miniature park, which is also accessible "
"with a pushchair, or to the Ponorka rock viewpoint."
